"description": "Healthcare Services Group, Inc. engages in the provision of healthcare management, administrative, and operating services. It operates through the following segments: Environmental Services (EVS) and Dietary. The EVS segment involves housekeeping, laundry, linen, and other services. The Dietary segment includes food purchasing, meal preparation, development of menus, and the provision of dietician consulting professional services. The company was founded by Daniel P. McCartney on November 22, 1976 and is headquartered in Bensalem, PA.",
